  message: "Investigation shows cross-file call resolution is working well. Average cross-file ratio is ~57% across 23 repos (range: 7-86%). The LLM assessments claiming 'no cross-file edges' were inaccurate. candle: 71%, zed: 66%, livekit: 86%, tmux: 69%. Only codex-acp (7%) shows weak cross-file resolution, likely due to small codebase with many external crate calls."  # 8642
